, 'text': 'JOPLIN, MO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MISSOURI AMERICAN WATER BRANSON TANK RECEIVES 2020 STEEL TANK OF THE YEAR AWARD'}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2021-08-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'MILLENNIUM SPACE SYSTEMS DEMONSTRATES DEPLOYABLE TAPE TECHNOLOGY', 'text': 'EL SEGUNDO, CALIF., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MILLENNIUM SPACE SYSTEMS, A BOEING (NYSE: BA) COMPANY, SUCCESSFULLY DEMONSTRATED THE ABILITY OF DEPLOYABLE TETHER TECHNOLOGY TO SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCE THE TIME A SATELLITE REMAINS ON ORBIT AFTER SERVICE LIFE COMPLETION.'}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-08-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER INVESTS IN ENEXOR BIOENERGY, WIDENS BREADTH OF SUSTAINABILITY BUSINESS', 'text': "AUBURN HILLS, MICH., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BORGWARNER IS EXPANDING THE BREADTH OF ITS SUSTAINABILITY BUSINESS ACTIVITIES BY INVESTING IN ENEXOR BIOENERGY, LLC, A COMPANY THAT PROVIDES ON-SITE, RENEWABLE ENERGY AND CARBON CONVERSION SOLUTIONS TO HELP SOLVE THE WORLD'S ORGANIC WASTE AND PLASTIC WASTE PROBLEMS."}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2021-08-23 06:59:00', 'title': "U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION ACCEPTS FOR PRIORITY REVIEW BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB'S APPLICATION FOR ORENCIA (ABATACEPT) FOR THE PREVENTION OF ACUTE GRAFT VERSUS HOST DISEASE (AGVHD)", 'text': "PRINCETON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $BMY #ABA2--US FDA ACCEPTS FOR PRIORITY REVIEW BMS'S APPLICATION FOR ORENCIA (ABATACEPT) FOR THE PREVENTION OF ACUTE GRAFT VERSUS HOST DISEASE (AGVHD)"}{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-08-23 12:00:00', 'title': "FIESTA BOWL AND CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT CREATE BOWL SEASON'S FIRST-EVER EXCLUSIVE SPORTS BETTING AND FANTASY GAMING PARTNERSHIP", 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ.\xa0AND LAS VEGAS, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE FIESTA BOWL ORGANIZATION TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS JOINED FORCES WITH CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0CZR) ("CAESARS") IN A FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND SPORTS BETTING AND FANTASY GAMING PARTNERSHIP FOR A COLLEGE FOOTBALL BOWL GAME.'}{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2021-08-23 11:45:00', 'title': 'CARDINAL HEALTH EXPANDS ITS DE&I EFFORTS WITH COMPREHENSIVE TALENT STRATEGY', 'text': 'DUBLIN, OHIO, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CARDINAL HEALTH (NYSE: CAH) ANNOUNCED TODAY A COMPREHENSIVE TALENT STRATEGY TO INCREASE REPRESENTATION OF DIVERSE EMPLOYEES AT THE MANAGER LEVEL AND ABOVE BY 2030. THIS COMMITMENT IS SPECIFICALLY AIMED AT INCREASING THE COMPANY\'S GLOBAL LEADERSHIP REPRESENTATION OF WOMEN, AS WELL AS AFRICAN AMERICAN AND BLACK, ASIAN, LATINX, INDIGENOUS AND ALL OTHER ETHNICALLY DIVERSE GROUPS IN LEADERSHIP ROLES IN THE U.S. "DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION ARE BUSINESS IMPERATIVES," SAID MIKE KAUFMANN, CEO OF CARDINAL HEALTH.'}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-08-23 18:05:00', 'title': "COMERICA BANK'S CALIFORNIA INDEX IMPROVES AGAIN", 'text': "DALLAS, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA BANK'S CALIFORNIA ECONOMIC ACTIVITY INDEX INCREASED IN JUNE TO A LEVEL OF 116.5. JUNE'S READING IS 25.5 PERCENT ABOVE THE HISTORICAL LOW OF 92.8 SET IN JUNE 2020."}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-08-23 17:55:00', 'title': "COMERICA BANK'S TEXAS INDEX IMPROVES", 'text': "DALLAS, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA BANK'S TEXAS ECONOMIC ACTIVITY INDEX INCREASED IN JUNE TO 125.2. JUNE'S INDEX READING WAS 26.1 PERCENT ABOVE THE RECENT LOW OF 99.3 SET IN JUNE 2020."}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-08-23 17:40:00', 'title': "COMERICA BANK'S MICHIGAN INDEX INCHES UP", 'text': "DALLAS, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMERICA BANK'S MICHIGAN ECONOMIC ACTIVITY INDEX INCREASED IN JUNE TO A LEVEL OF 107.2. JUNE'S READING WAS 24.9 PERCENT HIGHER THAN THE HISTORICAL LOW OF 85.8 REACHED IN JUNE 2020."}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-08-23 11:05:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK ANNOUNCES ESG PLATFORM, RELEASES ANNUAL CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT', 'text': 'DALLAS, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMERICA HAS RELEASED ITS CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT WHICH REPRESENTS THE 13TH CONSECUTIVE REPORT RELATED TO COMERICA\'S ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE PERFORMANCE. IN CONJUNCTION WITH THE REPORT, COMERICA ESTABLISHED AN ESG PLATFORM WHICH HIGHLIGHTS FIVE KEY ESG COMMITMENTS: PROVIDE ACCESS TO CAPITAL FOCUSED ON UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES, WOMEN, MINORITIES AND SMALL BUSINESSES PROMOTE A DIVERSE, INCLUSIVE AND EQUITABLE WORKFORCE INVEST IN FINANCIAL EDUCATION FOR UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES ADDRESS CLIMATE CHANGE ENHANCE ESG-RELATED PRODUCT AND SERVICE SOLUTIONS "COMERICA\'S ESG PLATFORM ILLUSTRATES WHAT WE BELIEVE TO BE THE MOST IMPACTFUL ESG ISSUES FOR OUR COMPANY, CUSTOMERS AND COLLEAGUES, AND THOSE IN WHICH WE FEEL THAT WE CAN MAKE A SIGNIFICANT DIFFERENCE," SAID CURT FARMER, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, COMERICA BANK AND COMERICA INCORPORATED.'}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2021-08-23 11:19:00', 'title': 'CVS HEALTH CORPORATION ANNOUNCES PRICING OF TENDER OFFER', 'text': 'WOONSOCKET, R.I., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CVS HEALTH CORPORATION ("CVS HEALTH", NYSE: CVS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE REFERENCE YIELD AND TOTAL CONSIDERATION (EACH AS SUMMARIZED IN THE TABLE BELOW) TO BE PAID IN CONNECTION WITH THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED CASH TENDER OFFER (THE "TENDER OFFER") FOR UP TO $2,049,919,000 PRINCIPAL AMOUNT (THE "MAXIMUM AMOUNT"), OF ITS 4.300% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2028 (THE "NOTES").'}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2021-08-23 07:00:00', 'title': 'CVS HEALTH CORPORATION ANNOUNCES EARLY RESULTS AND UPSIZE OF PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED CASH TENDER OFFER TO AN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $2,049,919,000 FROM $2,000,000,000', 'text': 'WOONSOCKET, R.I., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CVS HEALTH CORPORATION ("CVS HEALTH", NYSE: CVS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE EARLY RESULTS OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED CASH TENDER OFFER (THE "TENDER OFFER") AND THAT IT IS AMENDING THE TENDER OFFER BY INCREASING THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT TO $2,049,919,000 (AS INCREASED AND AMENDED, THE "MAXIMUM AMOUNT") FROM $2,000,000,000, OF ITS 4.300% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2028 (THE "NOTES").'}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-08-23 11:18:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY HONORS SIX COMPANIES WITH 2021 POWER PARTNER AWARDS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY HAS SELECTED SIX ORGANIZATIONS TO RECEIVE ITS 2021 POWER PARTNER AWARDS.'}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-08-23 09:37:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY TEAMS WITH ACCENTURE AND MICROSOFT TO DEVELOP FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND METHANE-EMISSIONS MONITORING PLATFORM', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY (NYSE: DUK) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS WORKING WITH ACCENTURE (NYSE: ACN) AND MICROSOFT (NASDAQ: MSFT) ON THE DEVELOPMENT OF A NEW TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM DESIGNED TO MEASURE ACTUAL BASELINE METHANE EMISSIONS FROM NATURAL GAS DISTRIBUTION SYSTEMS.'}{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2021-08-23 08:01:00', 'title': 'DUPONT NAMES LELAND WEAVER PRESIDENT, DUPONT WATER & PROTECTION', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT LELAND WEAVER HAS BEEN NAMED PRESIDENT, DUPONT WATER & PROTECTION EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 1, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2021-08-23 12:45:00', 'title': 'ECOLAB ANNOUNCES PRICING TERMS OF EXCHANGE OFFERS', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN., AUG. 23, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ECOLAB INC. (“ECOLAB”) (NYSE:ECL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING TERMS WITH RESPECT TO ITS PRIVATE EXCHANGE OFFERS (AS DEFINED BELOW) TO CERTAIN ELIGIBLE HOLDERS TO EXCHANGE ITS OUTSTANDING NOTES OF THE FOUR SERIES DESCRIBED IN THE TABLE BELOW (COLLECTIVELY, THE “OLD NOTES”) FOR UP TO $500 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT (THE “EXCHANGE CAP”) OF ITS NEWLY ISSUED 2.750% NOTES DUE 2055 (THE “NEW NOTES”) AND A CASH PAYMENT (THE “ADJUSTED CASH AMOUNT”). THE NEW NOTES WILL BE A FURTHER ISSUANCE OF, AND WILL BE IN ADDITION TO, THE 2.750% NOTES DUE 2055 (THE “ORIGINAL 2055 NOTES”) THAT ECOLAB ISSUED FOR CASH ON AUGUST 18, 2021, IN THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $300 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2021-08-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'ECOLAB ANNOUNCES EARLY PARTICIPATION DATE RESULTS FOR EXCHANGE OFFERS AND EXTENSION OF DEADLINE TO RECEIVE THE EARLY PARTICIPATION AMOUNT', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN., AUG. 23, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ECOLAB INC. (“ECOLAB”) (NYSE:ECL) TODAY ANNOUNCED RESULTS AS OF THE EXPIRATION OF THE EARLY PARTICIPATION PERIOD AT 5:00 P.M., NEW YORK CITY TIME, ON AUGUST 20, 2021 (THE “EARLY PARTICIPATION DATE”), OF ITS OFFERS (“EXCHANGE OFFERS”) TO CERTAIN ELIGIBLE HOLDERS TO EXCHANGE ITS OUTSTANDING NOTES OF THE FOUR SERIES DESCRIBED IN THE TABLE BELOW (COLLECTIVELY, THE “OLD NOTES”) FOR UP TO $500 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT (THE “EXCHANGE CAP”) OF ITS NEWLY ISSUED 2.750% NOTES DUE 2055 (THE “NEW NOTES”) AND CASH (INCLUDING CASH IN LIEU OF FRACTIONAL NEW NOTES). THE NEW NOTES WILL BE A FURTHER ISSUANCE OF, AND WILL BE IN ADDITION TO, THE 2.750% NOTES DUE 2055 (THE “ORIGINAL 2055 NOTES”) THAT ECOLAB ISSUED FOR CASH ON AUGUST 18, 2021, IN THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $300 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2021-08-23 07:45:00', 'title': 'NEW DIGITAL PAYMENTS IN 2021: OPPORTUNITIES AND CHARGEBACK RISKS SURVEY FROM KOUNT, AN EQUIFAX COMPANY, REVEALS PAYMENT OPPORTUNITIES AND RISKS FOR MERCHANTS', 'text': 'BOISE, IDAHO, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KOUNT, AN EQUIFAX COMPANY, THE LEADER IN DIGITAL IDENTITY TRUST AND FRAUD PREVENTION, HAS PUBLISHED THE FIRST OF ITS KIND "DIGITAL PAYMENTS IN 2021: OPPORTUNITIES AND CHARGEBACK RISKS" SURVEY. THE SURVEY TAKES A DEEP DIVE INTO 2021 CHARGEBACK TRENDS AND RISKS ACROSS CUSTOMER EXPERIENCES, BOTH PRE AND POST PAYMENT AUTHORIZATION.'}{'symbol': 'EXR', 'date': '2021-08-23 16:15:00', 'title': 'EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. ANNOUNCES 3RD QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC.\xa0(THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: EXR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.25 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY FOR THE THIRD QUARTER 2021, A 25% INCREASE FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'FFIV', 'date': '2021-08-23 07:00:00', 'title': 'F5 DOUBLES DOWN ON COMMITMENT TO OPEN SOURCE', 'text': "SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY AT ITS NGINX SPRINT 2.0 VIRTUAL CONFERENCE, F5 (NASDAQ: FFIV) ANNOUNCED SEVERAL NEW DEVELOPMENTS THAT UNDERSCORE ITS SUPPORT FOR CUSTOMERS MANAGING THE ACCELERATING PACE OF DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION AND THE CRITICAL ROLE OF OPEN SOURCE TECHNOLOGY IN DRIVING MODERN DIGITAL EXPERIENCES. “OVER THE PAST YEAR WE'VE PROVIDED CAPABILITIES CUSTOMERS RELY ON TO DELIVER THE NEXT GENERATION OF COMPELLING DIGITAL EXPERIENCES, FROM THE CODE THE DEVELOPERS BUILD TO THE CUSTOMERS"}{'symbol': 'FTNT', 'date': '2021-08-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'FORTIGUARD LABS REPORTS TENFOLD INCREASE IN RANSOMWARE', 'text': 'PUBLIC AND PRIVATE SECTOR ACTIONS ARE GAINING MOMENTUM IN DISRUPTING CYBERCRIME SUPPLY CHAINS PUBLIC AND PRIVATE SECTOR ACTIONS ARE GAINING MOMENTUM IN DISRUPTING CYBERCRIME SUPPLY CHAINS'}{'symbol': 'IT', 'date': '2021-08-23 08:45:00', 'title': 'GARTNER IDENTIFIES KEY EMERGING TECHNOLOGIES SPURRING INNOVATION THROUGH TRUST, GROWTH AND CHANGE', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #GARTNERSYM--ENGINEERING TRUST, ACCELERATING GROWTH AND SCULPTING CHANGE ARE THE THREE OVERARCHING TRENDS ON THE GARTNER, INC. HYPE CYCLE FOR EMERGING TECHNOLOGIES, 2021 THAT WILL DRIVE ORGANIZATIONS TO EXPLORE EMERGING TECHNOLOGIES SUCH AS NONFUNGIBLE TOKENS (NFT), SOVEREIGN CLOUD, DATA FABRIC, GENERATIVE AI AND COMPOSABLE NETWORKS TO HELP SECURE COMPETITIVE ADVANTAGE. “TECHNOLOGY INNOVATION IS A KEY ENABLER OF COMPETITIVE DIFFERENTIATION AND IS THE CATALYST FOR TRANSFORMI'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2021-08-23 15:26:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ACTION ALERT: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $GNRC #GNRC--SHAREHOLDER ACTI