ES DUE 2036 (THE "ORIGINAL NOTES") THAT HUNTINGTON ISSUED FOR CASH ON AUGUST 16, 2021, IN THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $500 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2021-08-23 06:00:00', 'title': 'INTEL WINS US GOVERNMENT PROJECT TO DEVELOP LEADING-EDGE FOUNDRY ECOSYSTEM', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTEL FOUNDRY SERVICES WILL LEAD THE FIRST PHASE OF THE DEFENSE DEPARTMENT'S RAMP-C PROGRAM TO ESTABLISH A DOMESTIC COMMERCIAL FOUNDRY INFRASTRUCTURE."}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-08-23 00:01:00', 'title': 'IBM UNVEILS ON-CHIP ACCELERATED ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE PROCESSOR', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AT THE ANNUAL HOT CHIPS CONFERENCE, IBM (NYSE:\xa0IBM) TODAY UNVEILED DETAILS OF THE UPCOMING NEW IBM TELUM PROCESSOR, DESIGNED TO BRING DEEP LEARNING INFERENCE TO ENTERPRISE WORKLOADS TO HELP ADDRESS FRAUD IN REAL-TIME.'}{'symbol': 'IP', 'date': '2021-08-23 17:11:00', 'title': 'INTERNATIONAL PAPER ANNOUNCES THE RECORD DATE AND DISTRIBUTION DATE IN CONNECTION WITH THE SPIN-OFF OF ITS PRINTING PAPERS BUSINESS', 'text': 'MEMPHIS, TENN., AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INTERNATIONAL PAPER (NYSE: IP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE TIMING AND ADDITIONAL DETAILS REGARDING THE SPINOFF OF ITS PRINTING PAPER BUSINESS, WHICH WILL BE KNOWN AS SYLVAMO CORPORATION ("SYLVAMO").'}{'symbol': 'IFF', 'date': '2021-08-23 18:32:00', 'title': 'IFF ANNOUNCES SALE OF MICROBIAL CONTROL BUSINESS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IFF (NYSE: IFF) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS MICROBIAL CONTROL BUSINESS UNIT TO LANXESS, A LEADING SPECIALTY CHEMICALS COMPANY THAT DEVELOPS, MANUFACTURES AND MARKETS CHEMICAL INTERMEDIATES, ADDITIVES, SPECIALTY CHEMICALS AND PLASTICS. THE TRANSACTION IS VALUED AT $1.3 BILLION AND THE CASH PROCEEDS NET OF TAXES AND EXPENSES WILL BE PRIMARILY USED TO REDUCE OUTSTANDING DEBT. “TODAY'S ANNOUNCEMENT IS PART OF A STRATEGIC PORTFOLIO REVIEW A"}{'symbol': 'JKHY', 'date': '2021-08-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'JACK